    "summary": "The user is consulting an AI acting as a Game Master (GM) about a risky tactical maneuver in a combat simulation. The AI initially provides a cautious assessment, then gives the user a high confidence rating of 8/10 to encourage the play, only to pivot back to caution when the user mentions specific terrain anomalies that might invalidate the strategy.",
